# ML Model Artifacts Directory

This directory stores trained model artifacts and metadata.

## Structure
- registry.json: Model registry metadata
- models/: Trained model files (joblib/pickle)
- metadata/: Model training metadata and manifests

## Security Note
- Never load arbitrary user-provided pickle/joblib files
- Validate model IDs and versions before loading
- Artifact paths are validated to prevent path traversal
- No credentials are stored in artifacts

## Policy
- Models are only promoted after passing quality gates
- Insufficient data models are marked as UNAVAILABLE
- Baghewala public data is not used for continuous forecasting
- Synthetic data is never mixed with real data without labeling
